er/value "⟨1,\\,0⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379837} {:answer/id #uuid "63ca10a3-6abf-594c-bc38-1b37ffcbdc38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1-2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379838} {:answer/id #uuid "1730136e-f78b-5eda-af0d-81956b5fce34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379839} {:answer/id #uuid "72d559c6-a1d1-5e3e-be26-d5a5b1c9e977" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨-1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379840}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186379839} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b446b32-d3dd-5edb-b643-a1c5a81e8d04" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379835}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "0407db63-d38b-50cb-b37f-dfd7ce1a8b10" :question/math-academy-id "q-42156" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "The system corresponding to $M$ is \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=1 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-2y=1.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=1+2y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=1+2y \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=⟨1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d7b917a4-149a-5335-87b0-b5af432e1dd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379836} {:answer/id #uuid "d5fcad4a-a362-5ebf-bbea-e056e83246a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1,\\,0⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379837} {:answer/id #uuid "63ca10a3-6abf-594c-bc38-1b37ffcbdc38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1-2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379838} {:answer/id #uuid "1730136e-f78b-5eda-af0d-81956b5fce34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379839} {:answer/id #uuid "72d559c6-a1d1-5e3e-be26-d5a5b1c9e977" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨-1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379840}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186379839} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b446b32-d3dd-5edb-b643-a1c5a81e8d04" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379835}]}
